Restore silent approval privacy for R1-BR review

Keep silent rejections private regardless of reason or self-claimed consent; do not introduce a trusted opt-in surface on the legacy transport. Filter non-silent rejection feedback, scrub approval diagnostics, and fix zero-suffix privacy masking. Preserve Trusted Action checks, batch protocol, native payloads and deployment blocks. Include scoped regression and original Git object evidence.
